  - _english: Warm turquoise water meets soft white sand beneath an endless open
      sky.
    _turkish: "Il\u0131k turkuaz su, u\xE7suz bucaks\u0131z g\xF6ky\xFCz\xFCn\xFCn
      alt\u0131nda yumu\u015Fak beyaz kumla bulu\u015Fur."
  - _english: Oceania
    _turkish: Okyanusya
  - _english: Desert Dunes
    _turkish: "\xC7\xF6l Kumullar\u0131"
  - _english: Rolling amber dunes catch the last light of dusk across a silent horizon.
    _turkish: "Dalgalanan kehribar kumullar sessiz ufukta g\xFCn\xFCn son \u0131\u015F\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131
      yakalar."
  - _english: Middle East
    _turkish: "Orta Do\u011Fu"
  - _english: Galata Tower
    _turkish: Galata Kulesi
  - _english: Galata Tower is one of Istanbul's best-known symbols and a defining
      part of the city's centuries-old silhouette. The foundations of today's tower
      were laid during the Genoese colony period in Galata in the 14th century, and
      the structure served different purposes over time. Standing about 67 metres
      tall, its location offers sweeping views of the Bosphorus, the Golden Horn,
      and the historic peninsula. Today, Galata Tower remains one of Istanbul's strongest
      historical reminders of the Byzantine, Genoese, and Ottoman eras.
    _turkish: "Galata Kulesi, \u0130stanbul\u2019un en tan\u0131nan simgelerinden
      biri ve \u015Fehrin y\xFCzy\u0131llara yay\u0131lan sil\xFCetinin \xF6nemli
      par\xE7alar\u0131ndand\u0131r. G\xFCn\xFCm\xFCzdeki kulenin temelleri, 14.
      y\xFCzy\u0131lda Galata\u2019daki Ceneviz kolonisi d\xF6neminde at\u0131lm\u0131\u015F
      ve yap\u0131 zaman i\xE7inde farkl\u0131 ama\xE7larla kullan\u0131lm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r.
      Yakla\u015F\u0131k 67 metre y\xFCksekli\u011Findeki kule, bulundu\u011Fu konum
      sayesinde \u0130stanbul Bo\u011Faz\u0131, Hali\xE7 ve tarih\xEE yar\u0131madaya
      h\xE2kim geni\u015F bir manzara sunar. Galata Kulesi bug\xFCn \u0130stanbul\u2019un
      Bizans, Ceneviz ve Osmanl\u0131 d\xF6nemlerini bir arada hat\u0131rlatan en
      g\xFC\xE7l\xFC tarih\xEE yap\u0131lardan biridir."
  - _english: Istanbul / TURKEY
    _turkish: "\u0130stanbul / T\xDCRK\u0130YE"
